	quest.2B10CF32CEDD0B22.quest_desc: [
		"&7Beat &f&levery one&r&7 of the &f&l28&r&7 Trainers of a &b&lTidal Spire&r&7, all seven floors, and the tower hands you its &d&lTrophy&r&7 on the spot."
