		"&7&l- &d&lGourgeist"
		"&7&l- &d&lGoodra"
		"&7&l- &d&lGardevoir"
		""
		"&7Perfect IVs, full EV spreads, held items. Level copies your strongest Pokémon."
		""
		"&7&oThis card is a guide: tick it once read. Your wins are counted by the quests above and below."
	]
	quest.33F0D4352116F2D4.quest_subtitle: "&7Kalos Champion &8- &7X / Y"
	quest.33F0D4352116F2D4.title: "&e&lDiantha"
	quest.33FE04A0F3A44A79.title: "Acquire Sneasler"
	quest.343DAE11210361DC.quest_desc: [
		"&6&lWhat it adds&r"
		"&7- &fAndesite&7, &fGranite&7 and &fDiorite&7 pebbles from dirt and gravel."
		"&7- &fSweet Berries&7, &fPink Petals&7 and &fPottery Sherds&7."
		""
		"&e&lTip:&r &7Every mesh is a &nseparate&r&7 loot table, not just a better one — keep the old meshes, some drops only exist on the lower tiers."
	]
	quest.343DAE11210361DC.quest_subtitle: "&7Tier 2 — stone variants and berries"
	quest.343DAE11210361DC.title: "&e&lFlint Mesh"
	quest.3487814C709CE2BD.quest_desc: ["&7Evolves at level &f&l40&r&7"]
	quest.34937318A4279675.quest_desc: [
		"&7One of the four pieces of the &a&lOrange Hair&r&7 outfit. Purely for looks."
		""
		"&7Crafted at the workbench - &bJEI&7 has the recipe."
		"&7The whole outfit is also the reward of the &9&lCascade Badge&r&7, in the Badge chapter."
	]
	quest.34937318A4279675.quest_subtitle: "&7Part of the Orange Hair outfit"
	quest.34937318A4279675.title: "&a&lOrange Hair Jacket"
	quest.34E101D44E029E66.quest_desc: ["{quest.minions.description.13}"]
	quest.34E101D44E029E66.title: "{quest.minions.title.14}"
	quest.34EC1E43FD5645AA.quest_desc: [
		"&7&oA citadel of grey stone on the highest peaks, where every Champion waits."
		""
		"&7The Battle Towers were the climb. The &e&lPokémon League&r&7 is the summit: &f&l12 Champions&r&7, one from every region from &fKanto&7 to &fPaldea&7, and at the far end of the nave, &6&lthe Rival&r&7."
		""
		"&e&lFINDING IT"
		"&7&l- &7It generates in the &a&lOverworld Mirror&r&7, on mountain tops only: &fjagged, frozen and stony peaks&7, and &fsnowy slopes"
		"&7&l- &7Much rarer than a tower: about one every &f&l44 chunks&r&7, and only where there is a peak"
		"&7&l- &b/battletower locate league&7 (or &b/bt&7) points you to the nearest one"
		"&7&l- &7The Mirror runs on the &c&ldimension timer&r&7: go in with time to spare"
		""
		"&e&lHOW THE BATTLES WORK"
		"&7&l- &7Right-click a Champion to challenge them. &a&lHeal first&r&7: with a fainted team they turn you away"
		"&7&l- &7Every Champion runs &f&l6 Pokémon&r&7 with &f&l31 IVs&r&7, full EV spreads, held items and built movesets"
		"&7&l- &7Their level &f&lcopies your strongest Pokémon&r&7, exactly like in the towers"
		"&7&l- &7Each Champion beaten pays &6&l200 000 PokéDollars"
		""
		"&c&lA beaten Champion leaves for good. &7They vanish from the League once they lose, for everyone. On a server, the next player has to find another League."
		""
		"&e&lTHE RELIQUARY"
		"&7One chest in the citadel: Gold Bottle Caps, Ability Patches, Rare Candies, competitive held items and a few treasures."
		""
		"&e&lYOUR PROGRESS"
		"&b/battletower progress&7 lists your towers and how many Champions you have beaten."
	]
	quest.34EC1E43FD5645AA.quest_subtitle: "&7Twelve Champions, one Rival, one trophy"
	quest.34EC1E43FD5645AA.title: "&e&lThe Pokémon League"
	quest.35833E8C6A8EA7DF.quest_desc: [
		"&7Awarded by &f&lSentinel Cobalt&r&7, &oTower Warden&r&7."
		"&7Found in the &b&lTidal Spire&r&7, on &f&lfloor 3&r&7 of 7."
		""
		"&e&lTeam:&r &fLucario&7, &fMetagross&7, &fScizor&7, &fSteelix"
		"&7IVs of &f&l16&r&7 in every stat, levels scaled to your strongest Pokémon."
		""
		"&7Beating them also pays &6&l650&r&7 PokéDollars. They won't battle you again for &f&l20 hours&r&7."
	]
	quest.35833E8C6A8EA7DF.quest_subtitle: "&bTidal Spire &8- &7Floor 3"
	quest.3586D233A578FBBC.quest_desc: [
