	quest.35E1564DC9621C54.quest_desc: [
		"&7The same &a&lCobblestone Minion&r&7, one tier up."
		""
		"&e&lUPGRADING"
		"&7Right click the placed minion and press &aUpgrade&7. The cost of every tier is in JEI."
		"&7To hand it in, press &aPickup&7: the minion comes back as an item &f&lat its tier&r&7."
		""
		"&7This is where the starter line stops. The &5&lPixelGO Minions&r&7 chapter takes it from here."
	]
	quest.35E1564DC9621C54.quest_subtitle: "&7Tier IV: faster, and it holds more"
	quest.35E1564DC9621C54.title: "&7&lCobblestone Minion IV"
	quest.360D5DE82359532A.quest_desc: [
		"&7The same &6&lAeternalis Fuel Block&r&7 as on the main line. Here it is the step to the next ticket tier."
		""
		"&7Unlocks the &9&lBlue Ticket&r&7 and the &fBlue Egg [MK 6]&7 - see &6JEI&7."
