		"&7No need to break the old one: the matching &a&lGenerator Upgrade&r&7, used with &bCrouch + Right Click&7 on the stone generator, turns it into this one."
		"&7Already upgraded it in the world? &aBreak it&7: a generator always drops itself, tier included, so you can hand it in."
	]
