	quest.3BB0495ED0211B47.quest_desc: [
		"&7The tier after the &a&lEmerald Cobblestone Generator&r&7: faster, and it holds more."
		""
		"&e&lWHAT IT GIVES"
		"&7&l- &7Speed &8- &f&l4&r&7 a second"
		"&7&l- &7Storage &8- &f&l64&r&7 cobblestone before it stops"
		""
		"&e&lUPGRADING IN PLACE"
		"&7No need to break the old one: the matching &a&lGenerator Upgrade&r&7, used with &bCrouch + Right Click&7 on the emerald generator, turns it into this one."
		"&7Already upgraded it in the world? &aBreak it&7: a generator always drops itself, tier included, so you can hand it in."
		""
		"&a&lThe fastest generator you can build. &7Only the creative one goes further."
	]
	quest.3BB0495ED0211B47.quest_subtitle: "&74 cobblestones a second"
	quest.3BB0495ED0211B47.title: "&5&lNetherite Cobblestone Generator"
	quest.3BCEAD2FA7D45AB1.quest_desc: [
		"&7Put it in a &a&lFossil Machine&r&7 to revive a completely random Pokémon."
		""
		"&e&lWHERE IT COMES FROM"
		"&7&l- &7Mine &a&lFossil&r&7 ore with a normal pickaxe: one drops with the usual fossils. &c&lSilk Touch gives the ore block instead."
		"&7&l- &7Crush raw fossil in the &a&lCrusher&r&7 (Cyclic)."
