		"&7&l- &fTeam Drill&7 - your &fwhole party&7 gains experience, 20 min"
		"&7&l- &fMove Lessons&7 - learns a new move, Great Ball and up, 40 min"
		"&7&l- &fDay Out&7 - raises friendship, 15 min"
		""
