	quest.6C5BFE5667EF3B08.quest_desc: [
		"&7The core of a &fInfinite&7 fluid disk: &f&lno limit at all&r&7."
		"&7Fluid disks hold &flava, water, essences...&7 and show them in the Grid, beside your items."
