	quest.6C5BFE5667EF3B08.title: "&3&lInfinite Fluid Storage Part"
	quest.6C7A7D10F4DDA281.quest_desc: [
		"&7The &d&lPower Pot I&r&7, one tier up."
		""
		"&e&lWHAT IT GIVES"
		"&7&l- &7Growth speed &8- &a&lx3"
		"&7&l- &7Yield &8- &a&lx1.5"
		""
		"&e&lWHAT IT NEEDS"
		"&7&l- &7Power &8- &f&l20&r&7 FE per tick, &f&l2000&r&7 FE stored"
		"&c&lNo power, no boost. &7Run a cable or a generator into it."
	]
	quest.6C7A7D10F4DDA281.quest_subtitle: "&7Crops grow x3, yield x1.5"
	quest.6C7A7D10F4DDA281.title: "&d&lPower Pot II"
	quest.6C9E3E51BD57D41C.quest_desc: [
		"&7The stone that opens &d&lProjectE&r&7. It is never used up: every recipe that needs it hands it back."
		"&7It is one of the last items of the pack: it is made from the items of the &5&lCreative Items&r&7 chapter that need no ProjectE - see &6JEI&7."
		""
		"&e&lWHAT IT DOES"
		"&7- &fRight-click&7 a block to transmute it into its counterpart (stone, dirt, sand, logs...). &fSneak&7 for the alternate result."
		"&7- the &fCharge&7 key widens the area, &fChange Mode&7 switches between cube, panel and line."
		"&7- the &fExtra Function&7 key opens a crafting grid anywhere."
		"&7- it steps the alchemical fuels up and down, and every machine of this chapter needs it somewhere upstream."
		""
		"&c&lEMC GENERATION IS DISABLED"
		"&7Nothing in this pack creates EMC out of thin air: the &fEnergy Collectors&7 and &fAnti-Matter Relays&7 have been removed, and so has Project Expansion. Every point of EMC you own comes from an item you burned yourself."
		"&7Anything a shop buys - diamonds, crops, cobblestone... - is worth &f0 EMC&7 and cannot be burned."
	]
	quest.6C9E3E51BD57D41C.quest_subtitle: "&7The key to the whole chapter"
	quest.6C9E3E51BD57D41C.title: "&d&lThe Philosopher's Stone"
	quest.6CC8B1CC7EF60F0E.quest_desc: [
		"&7A Minion is a small worker you place on your island. Give it a patch to work and it mines, chops or farms forever, including while you are offline."
		""
		"&e&lWHY THEY MATTER"
		"&7Minions are the only realistic road to the &5&lenchanted items&r&7 this pack gates its endgame behind. One enchanted item costs &c&l288&r&7 of the base item. One enchanted &oblock&r&7 costs &c&l2592&r&7."
		""
		"&e&lMAKE THEM FASTER"
		"&7&l- &a&lCompactor&r&7 compresses the output in place"
		"&7&l- &a&lSuper Compactor 3000&r&7 goes straight to enchanted items"
		"&7&l- &a&lSolar Panel&r&7 speeds them up while the sun is out"
		"&7&l- &a&lAuto Smelter&r&7 turns ore into ingots with no furnace"
		""
		"&c&lThe tools are not craftable. &7Hoes, axes and sickles come from the Minion Tools shop and nowhere else."
		""
		"&7The &d&lPixelGO Minions&r&7 chapter covers the whole ladder."
	]
	quest.6CC8B1CC7EF60F0E.quest_subtitle: "&7Workers that never stop"
	quest.6CC8B1CC7EF60F0E.title: "&d&lMinions"
	quest.6CD5D7AEF33DA2B2.quest_desc: [
		"&7Right-click one of your Pokémon to set it to a random level between &f&l1&r&7 and &f&l100&r&7."
		""
		"&c&lIt can send a level 90 back to level 3."
		""
		"&7Made at the &a&lUltimate Crafting Table&r&7 (Extended Crafting) from one of every berry - &bJEI&7 has the recipe."
