		"&7The &f&lSinnoh&r&7 Champion, from &fDiamond / Pearl&7."
		""
		"&e&lTEAM"
		"&7&l- &d&lSpiritomb"
		"&7&l- &d&lRoserade"
		"&7&l- &d&lGastrodon"
		"&7&l- &d&lLucario"
		"&7&l- &d&lMilotic"
		"&7&l- &d&lGarchomp"
		""
		"&7Perfect IVs, full EV spreads, held items. Level copies your strongest Pokémon."
