	quest.7DB167FB8ECCA4FF.quest_desc: [
		"&7The strongest armor of ProjectE. With the full set, almost no damage gets through."
		"&7This piece: it carries the powers of the &fEvertide Amulet&7 and the &fSoul Stone&7, and its offensive ability calls down &flightning&7. Read its tooltip in game for the keys."
		""
		"&7Made at the &fUltimate Crafting Table&7 (9x9), around the matching &cRed Matter&7 piece, with &dCreative Essence&7, &5Master Balls&7 and EMC Singularities."
		"&7Recipe in &6JEI&7."
	]
	quest.7DB167FB8ECCA4FF.quest_subtitle: "&7Red Matter Gem Armor"
	quest.7DB167FB8ECCA4FF.title: "&c&lGem Helmet"
	quest.7DE542F915D39386.quest_desc: [
		"&7Your island is small on purpose. Everything you will ever need can be made from what is already on it. The only trick is knowing what turns into what."
		""
		"&e&lTHE THREE THINGS YOU NEED FIRST"
		"&f1. &7A &a&lcobblestone generator&r&7 for infinite stone."
		"&f2. &7A &a&lsieve&r&7 to turn dirt, sand and gravel into ores and seeds."
		"&f3. &7A &a&lcrucible&r&7 to melt wood into lava, or stone into water."
		""
		"&7The chapter &e&lThe beginning&r&7 walks you through all three, step by step."
		""
		"&c&lDo not throw your dirt away. &7Cobblestone is infinite. Dirt is not, until the sieve is running."
	]
	quest.7DE542F915D39386.quest_subtitle: "&7Everything starts on this rock"
	quest.7DE542F915D39386.title: "&a&lYour Island"
	quest.7DEB815F7679EBB6.quest_desc: ["&7Smelts far faster than a vanilla furnace and holds several stacks of input and output, so it can run on its own for a long time. Any furnace fuel works, and hoppers or pipes can feed it."]
